IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bk63-nouns`
IMPORT `bk63-cross-references`

-- Row il-63. The controls hold, and the recorded facts about the defect are what NOTES.md says they are.
-- The defect itself is NOT asserted sound anywhere in this file: its three failing assertions are in bk63-tests-xrefs-red.l4.
-- Every expected value is written from the texts quoted in bk63-cross-references.l4, not from the output of the module.

§ `Tests of the sound controls`

-- I1 control (1): the reference in s 3 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 3510 points at what it says, its target has what it names, and it names the subsection that holds what it says.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: s 3 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 3510, to a determination under s 5ב1(ה)`)
#ASSERT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: s 3 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 3510, to a determination under s 5ב1(ה)`)
#ASSERT `the citing words name the subsection that holds what they say` (`reference: s 3 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 3510, to a determination under s 5ב1(ה)`)
-- I1 control (2): the words the instrument inserted and the words the consolidation prints at that place are the same words, and name the same citation.
#ASSERT `the two printings say the same words` (`citation: the words inserted by s 2(1)(א), SH 2712 p. 454`) (`citation: the words the consolidation prints in the opening of s 5ב(א)`)
#ASSERT `the two printings name the same citation` (`citation: the words inserted by s 2(1)(א), SH 2712 p. 454`) (`citation: the words the consolidation prints in the opening of s 5ב(א)`)

§ `Tests of what the subsections hold`

-- Subsection (א) of s 5ב1 holds the definitions and contains the definition of the term; subsection (ה) holds the power and does not.
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(א), the definitions`)'s `the label printed` EQUALS "(א)"
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(א), the definitions`)'s `what it holds` EQUALS `the definitions of the terms the section uses`
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(א), the definitions`)'s `it contains the definition of the term financial activity`
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(ה), the power`)'s `the label printed` EQUALS "(ה)"
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(ה), the power`)'s `what it holds` EQUALS `a power of the Governor, with the consent of the Minister of Finance, to determine that the section does not apply to a bank, applies to it later, or applies to it only in part`
#ASSERT NOT (`subsection: s 5ב1(ה), the power`)'s `it contains the definition of the term financial activity`
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(א), the definitions`)'s `it was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
#ASSERT (`subsection: s 5ב1(ה), the power`)'s `it was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

§ `Tests of what the reference records (I1)`

-- The words of s 5ב(א) name one definition, in the subsection labelled (ה); the target has none; the subsection that holds the definition is labelled (א).
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `how many things the citing words name` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `how many of them the target has` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `the label the citing words name` EQUALS "(ה)"
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `the label of the subsection that holds what the citing words say` EQUALS "(א)"
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `the citing words say it points at` EQUALS `the definition of the term financial activity`
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `the target is` EQUALS `a power of the Governor, with the consent of the Minister of Finance, to determine that the section does not apply to a bank, applies to it later, or applies to it only in part`
#ASSERT NOT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)
#ASSERT NOT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)
#ASSERT NOT `the citing words name the subsection that holds what they say` (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)
-- The defect and its control name the same subsection.
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `the label the citing words name` EQUALS (`reference: s 3 of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 3510, to a determination under s 5ב1(ה)`)'s `the label the citing words name`
-- Where each limb was read from: both limbs of the defect from the official page of the instrument that wrote the words, the crop deposited; the later printing of the same words from the consolidation only.
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
#ASSERT (`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
#ASSERT (`citation: the words the consolidation prints in the opening of s 5ב(א)`)'s `they were read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
#ASSERT (`citation: the words inserted by s 2(1)(א), SH 2712 p. 454`)'s `they were read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
